        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bbd196c0-3354-441c-aa64-9180ac335d9f).Image",
        "Description": "It&apos;s Summer and the Weather is great in England for once. The Owners of a large Mansion in Dartmor have therefore decided to organize a big Garden show, a perfect Opportunity. \rEliminate the 2 Providence Members Gulshan Yazdani and his partner Sebastian Sato, also eliminate Mr. Yazdani&apos;s Son-in-Law Theo Willis. Theo knows about the Providence. He is doing an Internship as a Waiter. The Client doesn&apos;t want to cause a big stir, so you should only eliminate yourTargets.\rGood Luck 47",
